At the end of a quiet close, ten minutes from the centre of Millbrook and its cafés, this {area} house on a
{plot} plot has three bedrooms, a bright living room opening onto the garden, a utility room and a garage.

![The living room, south-facing](house-elm-grove/photos/02-living-room.jpg)

The living room, the kitchen and the main bedroom are all on the ground floor (see the
[ground floor plan](house-elm-grove/ground-floor.pdf)). Offers in the region of {price}, with no onward
chain. Viewings by appointment with [[agents/helen-carter]], the next one on {viewing}.

